    {
      "fileName": "powerful-shove.json",
      "id": "oIE88rIDEFNm83Mr",
      "name": "Powerful Shove",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "oIE88rIDEFNm83Mr",
        "folder": "EfAhkeT2DBo6O7NS",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Powerful Shove",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You can push larger foes around with your attack. You can use @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Aggressive Block] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Brutish Shove] against a creature up to two sizes larger than you.</p>\n<p>When a creature you Shove or knock back with a shield, polearm, or club's critical specialization effect has to stop moving because it would hit an object, it takes @Damage[@actor.abilities.str.mod]{damage} equal to your Strength modifier (minimum 1).</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 4
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Aggressive Block or Brutish Shove"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "traits": {
